    "runtime_tests": "source tools/native-sdl/activate.sh && python3 -m unittest discover -s native/tests -p test_field_viewer.py -v",
    "scope": "Independent C fixtures include signed matrix IDs and unsigned zone IDs, LOD planes, camera capacity, malformed offsets/padding/counts, owned output cleanup, and vertical/sloped/overlapping fixed triangles. Runtime fixtures cover raw/LZ archive chains, exact full-word marker policy, region placement, absent regions, captures/no-clobber, clipped large collision edges, and repeated-region instance budget."
